# Build output is COMMITTED in this repo, deliberately — GitHub Pages serves
# docs/ and there is no build step on GitHub's side, so docs/index.html is the
# published game rather than an artifact to be regenerated.
# BOTH FORMS. `node_modules/` with the slash matches a directory and does NOT
# match a SYMLINK called node_modules — which is how a worktree gets its
# dependencies here, and how a symlink to another checkout's node_modules ended
# up committed as a file.
node_modules/
node_modules
shots/
*.tgz
